Description: Yu OS — graphical Yu Agent
 The desktop window, Ask Yu overlay, session bridge and Browser chat host
 of the official Yu Agent. Without it the desktop and every App keep
 working; only Agent features such as Ask Yu report that they are
 unavailable.
